{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If an object is approached, take it, process it, else move and scan to find it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />\"",
